    "summary": "Added src/shared/locks/__tests__/lock-manager-threads.test.ts and helper worker helpers/lock-ops-worker.ts (scripted hold/release/probe/query/nested ops, and a pause-at op that blocks the worker at a chosen grant point via the t2 hook so the test can terminate it there). Nine tests over real worker_threads sharing one block prove every integration subject of the LLD's test strategy, including the measured wake gap (< 50 ms between one worker's release and another's grant) and termination at each of the three grant points with watchWorker reclaim. Ran stable 4 times; mutants (late threadId in watchWorker, no mutex takeover, no recount) each fail tests here.",
